      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Most real world cameras have a status LED for that too.\nI have UI sounds muted (they annoy me) but that also mutes the Camera. The only way I know that I took a screenshot is from the lag spike (I set the resolution to 4K).\nI also don't know when other people that pictures. Having some kind of small flash effect on the camera would be nice.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
