  "details": "Add a camera flash particle/sprite to open beta cam, as well as a text-based timer above it so that the camera is more accessible to deaf people. Would rather it be visible to all players, not just the person taking the photo.\n\n*Admin note: Version 1337 is not a valid version. Reverted to 1140.*",
